# Runtime outputs -- session artifacts and raw observation streams. These are
# DATA, produced by every run, and are backed up by scripts/backup_observation_stores.py
# (16:30 daily, /opt/bujji/backups). They are deliberately not version control:
# a git add -A during a hotfix would otherwise sweep in a days worth of live
# session output alongside a two-line code change.
